    <string name="privacy_policy">Privacy policy</string>
    <string name="licenses_text">N3-Core (formerly N3-Core and Notebook) is released under the MIT License.\n\nIt is built with the following open-source libraries, used under the Apache License 2.0 unless stated otherwise:\n• Kotlin and kotlinx.coroutines, kotlinx.serialization (JetBrains)\n• AndroidX: Compose, Material 3, Room, DataStore, WorkManager, Navigation, Lifecycle, Biometric, Glance\n• Dagger Hilt (Google)\n• Coil (Coil Contributors)\n• JUnit 4 (Eclipse Public License 1.0), Robolectric (MIT)\n\nFull license texts are available in each project\'s repository.</string>
    <string name="privacy_text">N3-Core stores all notes, attachments and settings on this device only. It has no account, no analytics and no server.\n\nNetwork access is used for one thing: fetching a page title when you tap Preview on a link, and only if link previews are enabled in Settings.\n\nBackups and exported files are written only to locations you pick. Microphone access is requested only when you record. Locked notes are encrypted with a key kept in the Android Keystore.\n\nSee PRIVACY.md in the source repository for the full policy.</string>

